OL,3,GNEWSAResidents object to stadium music
OL,4,Aevent over noise
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganiser Lab3events Ltd said it would
OL,7,Fbe the third time it held an event at
OL,8,Fthe stadium and previous "liaison and
OL,9,Fcollaboration with responsible
OL,10,Fauthorities worked exceptionally well".
